1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,700
Wait! Did you hear that?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,400
I thought you had the key.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,300
No, this door was already open.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Stay close. We should move quietly.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:15,700
You call that quietly?

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,400
Sorry. I stepped on a branch.

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,300
There is a light upstairs.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Then somebody is still here.

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,700
Hello? We mean you no harm.

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,400
Please put the lantern down.

11
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,300
Oh! You startled me.

12
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
We are looking for our friend.

13
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,700
She left a note on the table.

14
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,400
The bridge closes at midnight.

15
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:52,300
Midnight? We have only ten minutes!

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Take the path beside the river.

17
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,700
Thank you. We will be careful.

18
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,400
Promise me you will stay together.

19
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,300
I promise. Come on, Ren.

20
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Wait for me! I am coming.
